<headline>FINAL PRICING - Essex County, N.J..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities Inc said it has received the written award for $114 million of Essex County, N.J., general obligation refunding bonds, exempt series 1996 A-1 and taxable capital appreciation bonds, series 1996 A-2.</p>
